      "values:originalText": "(1) Subject to sub-section (2), this Act shall come into operation on the\ntwenty-eighth day after the day on which it receives the Royal Assent.\n(2) Section 3, sub-section 4 (2), sections 7, 22, 33 and 34 and section 37\nshall come into operation on a day to be fixed by Proclamation.\nTitle",
      "skos:definition": "(1) Subject to sub-section (2), this Act shall come into operation on the\ntwenty-eighth day after the day on which it receives the Royal Assent.\n(2) Section 3, sub-section 4 (2), sections 7, 22, 33 and 34 and section 37\nshall come into operation on a day to be fixed by Proclamation.\nTitle",
