    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-9",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "9 Section 9",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984#sec-9"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf, p.8",
      "values:originalText": "Section 10 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) \"by birth\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (2) \"A person shall\" and substituting\n\"Subject to sub-section (4), a person shall\";\n(c) by omitting from sub-sections (2) and (3) \"his father\" and substituting\n\"a parent of the person\";\n(d) by omitting from paragraph (2) (b) \"ordinarily resident in Australia\"\nand substituting \"a permanent resident\";\n(e) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"A person shall\" and substituting\n\"Subject to sub-section (5), a person shall\"; and\n(f)\nby adding at the end thereof the following sub-sections:\n\"(4) Sub-section (2) does not apply in relation to a person if, at the\ntime of his birth, a parent of the person was an Australian citizen or a\npermanent resident.\n\"(5) Sub-section (3) does not apply in relation to a person if, at the\ntime of his birth, a parent of the person—\n(a) was an Australian citizen or a permanent resident; and\n(b) was not an enemy alien.\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 10 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) \"by birth\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (2) \"A person shall\" and substituting\n\"Subject to sub-section (4), a person shall\";\n(c) by omitting from sub-sections (2) and (3) \"his father\" and substituting\n\"a parent of the person\";\n(d) by omitting from paragraph (2) (b) \"ordinarily resident in Australia\"\nand substituting \"a permanent resident\";\n(e) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"A person shall\" and substituting\n\"Subject to sub-section (5), a person shall\"; and\n(f)\nby adding at the end thereof the following sub-sections:\n\"(4) Sub-section (2) does not apply in relation to a person if, at the\ntime of his birth, a parent of the person was an Australian citizen or a\npermanent resident.\n\"(5) Sub-section (3) does not apply in relation to a person if, at the\ntime of his birth, a parent of the person—\n(a) was an Australian citizen or a permanent resident; and\n(b) was not an enemy alien.\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-9-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-9-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "9732b1070d524ebb440dda2615772121dfa8b1a69558972feee3dfe15ee69ffe",
      "skos:note": "Section 10 of the Principal Act is amended in various ways."
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984#sec-9",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "9 Section 9",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 8,
      "values:originalText": "Section 10 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from sub-section (1) \"by birth\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (2) \"A person shall\" and substituting\n\"Subject to sub-section (4), a person shall\";\n(c) by omitting from sub-sections (2) and (3) \"his father\" and substituting\n\"a parent of the person\";\n(d) by omitting from paragraph (2) (b) \"ordinarily resident in Australia\"\nand substituting \"a permanent resident\";\n(e) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"A person shall\" and substituting\n\"Subject to sub-section (5), a person shall\"; and\n(f)\nby adding at the end thereof the following sub-sections:\n\"(4) Sub-section (2) does not apply in relation to a person if, at the\ntime of his birth, a parent of the person was an Australian citizen or a\npermanent resident.\n\"(5) Sub-section (3) does not apply in relation to a person if, at the\ntime of his birth, a parent of the person—\n(a) was an Australian citizen or a permanent resident; and\n(b) was not an enemy alien.\"."
    },
    {
