      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (b) \"sub-section (2) of section 14\"\nand substituting \"sub-section 13 (2)\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"sub-section (8) of section 14\" and\nsubstituting \"sub-section 13 (9)\";\n(c) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"paragraph (d) of that sub-section\"\nand substituting \"sub-paragraph 13 (9) (d) (ii)\";and\n(d) by omitting from sub-section (4) \"sub-section (9) of section 14\" and\nsubstituting \"sub-section 13 (10)\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (b) \"sub-section (2) of section 14\"\nand substituting \"sub-section 13 (2)\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"sub-section (8) of section 14\" and\nsubstituting \"sub-section 13 (9)\";\n(c) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"paragraph (d) of that sub-section\"\nand substituting \"sub-paragraph 13 (9) (d) (ii)\";and\n(d) by omitting from sub-section (4) \"sub-section (9) of section 14\" and\nsubstituting \"sub-section 13 (10)\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-12-norm"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "5f15dbc3be13b959ea36eb5612209b54c24347d944b3022aa21ddc940da2b1a6",
      "skos:note": "Amendment of Section 15 of the Principal Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984#sec-12",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "12 Section 12",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "Section 15 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by omitting from paragraph (1) (b) \"sub-section (2) of section 14\"\nand substituting \"sub-section 13 (2)\";\n(b) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"sub-section (8) of section 14\" and\nsubstituting \"sub-section 13 (9)\";\n(c) by omitting from sub-section (3) \"paragraph (d) of that sub-section\"\nand substituting \"sub-paragraph 13 (9) (d) (ii)\";and\n(d) by omitting from sub-section (4) \"sub-section (9) of section 14\" and\nsubstituting \"sub-section 13 (10)\"."
    },
