    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-13",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "13 Section 13",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984#sec-13"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf, p.14",
      "values:originalText": "Section 17 of the Principal Act is repealed and the following section is\nsubstituted:\nLoss of citizenship on acquisition of another nationality\n\"17. (1) A person, being an Australian citizen who has attained the age of\n18 years, who does any act or thing—\n(a) the sole or dominant purpose of which; and\n(b) the effect of which,\nis to acquire the nationality or citizenship of a foreign country, shall, upon that\nacquisition, cease to be an Australian citizen.\n\"(2) Sub-section (1) does not apply in relation to an act of marriage.\".\nRenunciation of citizenship",
      "skos:definition": "Section 17 of the Principal Act is repealed and the following section is\nsubstituted:\nLoss of citizenship on acquisition of another nationality\n\"17. (1) A person, being an Australian citizen who has attained the age of\n18 years, who does any act or thing—\n(a) the sole or dominant purpose of which; and\n(b) the effect of which,\nis to acquire the nationality or citizenship of a foreign country, shall, upon that\nacquisition, cease to be an Australian citizen.\n\"(2) Sub-section (1) does not apply in relation to an act of marriage.\".\nRenunciation of citizenship",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-13-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-13-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "6e024ed660bb9fdf245ef2b3e64fa2e191241de81e0719dd44c10c964d9e300b",
      "skos:note": "Loss of Australian citizenship upon acquiring foreign nationality"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984#sec-13",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "13 Section 13",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 14,
      "values:originalText": "Section 17 of the Principal Act is repealed and the following section is\nsubstituted:\nLoss of citizenship on acquisition of another nationality\n\"17. (1) A person, being an Australian citizen who has attained the age of\n18 years, who does any act or thing—\n(a) the sole or dominant purpose of which; and\n(b) the effect of which,\nis to acquire the nationality or citizenship of a foreign country, shall, upon that\nacquisition, cease to be an Australian citizen.\n\"(2) Sub-section (1) does not apply in relation to an act of marriage.\".\nRenunciation of citizenship"
    },
    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-13-norm",
      "@type": "values:Prohibition",
      "cml:modality": {
