      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf, p.19",
      "values:originalText": "Section 42 of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by adding at the end of paragraph (b) \"and\";\n(b) by omitting from paragraph (d) all the words after\n\"entering\nAustralia\"; and\n(c) by omitting paragraph (e).\nDefinition of certificate of naturalization for certain purposes",
