    {
      "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-30",
      "@type": "cml:Concept",
      "skos:prefLabel": "30 Section 30",
      "cml:realizedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984#sec-30"
      },
      "cml:curationStatus": {
        "@id": "cml:Proposed"
      },
      "cml:schemaVersion": "2",
      "cml:proposedBy": {
        "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml"
      },
      "prov:wasDerivedFrom": {
        "@id": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf"
      },
      "dc:source": "australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984.pdf, p.20",
      "values:originalText": "Section 46A of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by inserting in sub-section (1) \", subject to sub-section ( l A ) , \" after\n\"the Secretary shall\";\n(b) by inserting after sub-section (1) the following sub-section:\n''(1A)\nAN applicant under sub-section (1) is not entitled to be\nissued with an evidentiary certificate in relation to a certificate of\nAustralian citizenship granted to a person specified in the application\nunless—\n(a) the applicant is, or is acting on behalf of—\n(i) the person so specified; or\n(ii) a person whose name was included in the certificate of\nAustralian citizenship;\n(b) the evidentiary certificate is required by the applicant for\npurposes in connection with the operation of a law in force in a\nforeign country or a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, including, but without limiting the generality of the\nforegoing, purposes in connection with an action or proceeding\nbefore a court, tribunal or authority; or\n(c) the authorized officer is satisfied that the applicant has some\nother legitimate reason for requiring the\nevidentiary\ncertificate.\"; and\n(c) by inserting in sub-section (8) \", in writing,\" after \"authorized\".",
      "skos:definition": "Section 46A of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by inserting in sub-section (1) \", subject to sub-section ( l A ) , \" after\n\"the Secretary shall\";\n(b) by inserting after sub-section (1) the following sub-section:\n''(1A)\nAN applicant under sub-section (1) is not entitled to be\nissued with an evidentiary certificate in relation to a certificate of\nAustralian citizenship granted to a person specified in the application\nunless—\n(a) the applicant is, or is acting on behalf of—\n(i) the person so specified; or\n(ii) a person whose name was included in the certificate of\nAustralian citizenship;\n(b) the evidentiary certificate is required by the applicant for\npurposes in connection with the operation of a law in force in a\nforeign country or a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, including, but without limiting the generality of the\nforegoing, purposes in connection with an action or proceeding\nbefore a court, tribunal or authority; or\n(c) the authorized officer is satisfied that the applicant has some\nother legitimate reason for requiring the\nevidentiary\ncertificate.\"; and\n(c) by inserting in sub-section (8) \", in writing,\" after \"authorized\".",
      "cml:asserts": [
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-30-norm"
        },
        {
          "@id": "concept:australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984-sec-30-logic-deontic-1"
        }
      ],
      "cml:integrityHash": "eaeeba3d10c6bc3fa419dcf64ed0aea3fbd1f2970b470599d3eec3fe593837ca",
      "skos:note": "Amendment of Section 46A of the Principal Act"
    },
    {
      "@id": "https://ns.webcivics.net/values/australian-citizenship-amendment-act-1984#sec-30",
      "@type": "cof:Section",
      "cof:title": "30 Section 30",
      "values:kind": "section",
      "cof:pageNumber": 20,
      "values:originalText": "Section 46A of the Principal Act is amended—\n(a) by inserting in sub-section (1) \", subject to sub-section ( l A ) , \" after\n\"the Secretary shall\";\n(b) by inserting after sub-section (1) the following sub-section:\n''(1A)\nAN applicant under sub-section (1) is not entitled to be\nissued with an evidentiary certificate in relation to a certificate of\nAustralian citizenship granted to a person specified in the application\nunless—\n(a) the applicant is, or is acting on behalf of—\n(i) the person so specified; or\n(ii) a person whose name was included in the certificate of\nAustralian citizenship;\n(b) the evidentiary certificate is required by the applicant for\npurposes in connection with the operation of a law in force in a\nforeign country or a law of the Commonwealth, a State or a\nTerritory, including, but without limiting the generality of the\nforegoing, purposes in connection with an action or proceeding\nbefore a court, tribunal or authority; or\n(c) the authorized officer is satisfied that the applicant has some\nother legitimate reason for requiring the\nevidentiary\ncertificate.\"; and\n(c) by inserting in sub-section (8) \", in writing,\" after \"authorized\"."
    },
    {
