rescribed evidentiary\ncertificate\")\n\"sub-section (2) of this section\"\n\"sub-section (2)\"\nSub-section 44A (1) (paragraph\n(a) of the definition of\n\"prescribed evidentiary\ncertificate\")\n\"sub-section (2) of this section\"\n\"sub-section (2)\"\nSub-section 44A (1) (paragraph\n(a) of the definition of\n\"prescribed evidentiary\ncertificate\")\n\"sub-section (2) of this section\"\n\"sub-section (2)\"\nSub-section 44A (1) (paragraph\n(a) of the definition of\n\"prescribed evidentiary\ncertificate\")\n\"sub-section (2) of this section\"\n\"sub-section (2)\"\nTHE SCHEDULE\nSection 38\nF O R M A L\nA M E N D M E N T S\n\nAustralian Citizenship Amendment No. 129, 1984\nSCHEDULE—continued\nProvision amended\nOmit—\nSubstitute—\nSub-section 44A (1) (paragraph\n(b) of the definition of\n\"prescribed evidentiary\ncertificate\")\n\"(3) of section 11C\"\n\"1948-1969\"\n\"11c (3)\"\n\"1948\"\nSub-section 44A (2)\n\"1948-1969\"\n\"1948\"\nSub-section 44A (8)\n\"(8) of section 11c\"\n\"1948-1969\"\n\"11c (8)\"\n\"1948\"\nParagraph 46A (4) (a)\n\"(a) and (b) of sub-section (2)\"\n\"(2) ( a ) a n d ( b ) \"\nParagraph 46A (4) (b)\n\"(c) of sub-section (2)\"\n\"(2) (c)\"\nParagraph 46A (4) (c)\n\"(d) of sub-section (2)\"\n\"(2) ( d ) \"\nSub-section 46A (5)\n\"(c) of sub-section (2)\"\n\"(2) (c)\"\nSub-section 46A (7)\n\"the last preceding sub-section\"\n\"sub-section (6)\"\nSub-section 50 (2)\n\"the last preceding sub-section\"\n\"ten\"\n\"sub-section (1)\"\n\"10\"\nNOTE",
